The user will ask something like: "I'd like to prepare for my annual physical. I'm 52, with atrial fibrillation (levothyroxine 75mcg), GERD (gabapentin 300mg), and a history of back pain. My PCP is Dr. Amy Foster at Denver Heart Instit..."

Use topic-level wording in the rule you want stored (e.g. "taxes, filing, deductions, IRS" not just "taxes") so it generalizes to other phrasings.


